                    "description_zh": "无损弹性，是否开启规格外突发弹性能力。\n\n仅当supportAutoScaling参数值为enable，即实例支持开启弹性能力，该参数才有效",
                    "enumValueTitles": {
                      "false": "不开启弹性能力",
                      "true": "开启弹性能力"
                    },
                    "example": "true",
                    "title_en": "",
                    "title_zh": "是否开启无损弹性伸缩",
                    "type": "boolean"
                  },
                  "capacityType": {
                    "description_en": "The capacity mode",
                    "description_zh": "容量模式",
                    "enumValueTitles": {
                      "ondemand": "按量付费",
                      "provisioned": "预留+弹性"
                    },
                    "example": "provisioned",
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "drReplicationMode": {
                    "description_en": "The cross-region replication mode",
                    "description_zh": "跨地域复制模式",
                    "example": "async_cross_az",
                    "title_en": "",
                    "title_zh": "跨地域复制模式",
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "maxDelayTime": {
                    "description_en": "The maximum interval for scheduled messages. Unit: seconds",
                    "description_zh": "定时消息最大间隔，单位：秒",
                    "example": "3456000",
                    "format": "int32",
                    "type": "integer"
                  },
                  "messageRetentionTime": {
                    "description_en": "The message retention period. Unit: hours",
                    "description_zh": "消息保存时长。单位：小时。\n\n取值范围，请参见[使用限制]（https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/440347.html）>资源配额>消息保存时长的限制值。\n\n消息队列RocketMQ版的消息存储完全实现Serverless弹性，按照实际存储空间收取费用，您可以通过调整消息保存时长来控制消息的存储容量。更多信息，请参见[存储费用]（https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/427238.html）",
                    "example": "72",
                    "format": "int32",
                    "title_en": "",
                    "title_zh": "消息保留时长",
                    "type": "integer"
                  },
                  "msgProcessSpec": {
                    "description_en": "The message processing specification. For the TPS upper limit of message sending and receiving, see [Instance specifications]（https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/444715.html）",
                    "description_zh": "消息收发计算规格。具体消息收发TPS上限，请参见[实例规格]（https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/444715.html）",
                    "example": "rmq.s2.2xlarge",
                    "title_en": "",
                    "title_zh": "消息收发规格",
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "provisionedCapacity": {
                    "description_en": "The reserved capacity",
                    "description_zh": "预留容量",
                    "example": "3000",
                    "format": "int64",
                    "type": "integer"
                  },
                  "sendReceiveRatio": {
                    "description_en": "The ratio of message sending to message receiving",
                    "description_zh": "消息发送和接收的比例",
                    "example": "0.5",
                    "format": "float",
                    "title_en": "",
                    "title_zh": "消息收发比例",
                    "type": "number"
                  },
                  "storageEncryption": {
                    "description_en": "Indicates whether storage encryption is enabled",
                    "description_zh": "是否开启存储加密",
                    "example": "false",
                    "title_en": "",
                    "title_zh": "是否开启存储加密",
                    "type": "boolean"
                  },
                  "storageSecretKey": {
                    "description_en": "The storage encryption key",
                    "description_zh": "存储加密密钥Key",
                    "example": "xxxxx",
                    "title_en": "",
                    "title_zh": "存储加密密钥Key",
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "supportAutoScaling": {
                    "description_en": "Indicates whether the burstable elasticity capability beyond the specification is supported",
                    "description_zh": "是否支持开启规格外突发弹性能力。\n\n\n开启弹性突发能力后，消息队列RocketMQ允许该实例在一定范围内超过基础规格限制的TPS，且超过基础规格外的部分，需要收取额外的弹性规格费用。具体计费信息，请参见[计算能力费用]（https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/427237.html）。\n\n\n仅部分规格的实例支持开启弹性突发规格能力，具体支持的实例，请参见[实例规格]（https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/444715.html）",
                    "enumValueTitles": {
                      "false": "不支持开启弹性能力",
                      "true": "支持开启弹性能力"
                    },
                    "example": "true",
                    "title_en": "",
                    "title_zh": "是否支持弹性伸缩",
                    "type": "boolean"
                  },
                  "traceOn": {
                    "description_en": "Indicates whether the message trace feature is enabled",
                    "description_zh": "是否开启消息轨迹功能。\ntrue：开启消息轨迹功能\nfalse：关闭消息轨迹功能\n\n<props=\"intl\">该参数暂不生效，不管参数是否开启，实例都默认支持轨迹功能。</props>\n<props=\"china\">该参数仅对Serverless类型的实例生效，若开启消息轨迹功能，会产生相关的消息轨迹费用，具体计费信息，请参见[Serverless计费说明]（https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/2586280.html）。</props>\n\n<props=\"china\">对于按量付费和包年包月实例，该参数不生效，即不管参数是否开启，都默认支持消息轨迹功能。</props>",
                    "example": "true",
                    "type": "boolean"
                  }
                },
